{
  "id": "MRK.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 4",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobayeeno bw’omobusuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 13:1-9; Luk 8:4-8)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso agachaaka kworokereria naende ase enyancha mbarabare, na omoganda omonene okamosangererekanera, goika ere akariina obwato, agaikaransa imeo igoro y’enyancha. Omoganda bwonsi nao orenge ase ense enyomo enyancha mbarabare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaborokereria amang’ana amange ase emebayeeno, akabateebia ase okworokereria kwaye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tegerera! Omobusuri akamanora kogenda kobusura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachia koba nkobusura are, chimbusuro chinde chikagwa ase enchera ensemo, chinyoni chigaacha chigachiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echinde chikagwa aase egetare kere, aase amaroba are amake; chikamera bwango, ekiagera amaroba arenge amake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omobaso ogachia kobara, chigasusana, na ekiagera chitarenge nemeri, chikooma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echinde chikagwa ase amagwa ime, na amagwa aria agakiina, agachimiga, tichiama amatunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echinde chikagwa ase amaroba amaya, chikaama endagera, chikamera na gokina, na kwama; echinde emerongo etato, na echinde emerongo etano nomo, naende echinde rigana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabora, “Oyore namato akoigwera tiga aigwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekerenga ki’ogokwana ase emebayeeno",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 13:10-17; Luk 8:9-10)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero arenge bweka, abanto baria bamoetanaine amo nabaria ikomi na babere bakamobooria amang’ana y’emebayeeno eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabateebia, “Inwe mwaeirwe komanya obobisi bw’oborwoti bwa Nyasae, korende ase abanto bare isiko, amang’ana onsi nigo are emebayeeno ase bare,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erio okorigereria nabarigererie, ko tibakorora, na okoigwa nabaigwe, ko tibakomanya; tibacha koonchoka, baaberwe ebibe biabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogotebereria kw’omobayeeno bw’omobusuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 13:18-23; Luk 8:11-15)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akabateebia, “Timomanyeti omobayeeno oyo? Gaki emebayeeno yonsi naki morayemanye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omobusuri nering’ana akobusura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bande nigo bare buna embusuro eyio ekogwa enchera ensemo; na barabwo kobaikire koriigwa ring’ana, bwango Saitani ocha orusia ring’ana riria riabusuirwe ase emioyo yabo ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bande nigo banga buna chimbusuro chiria chiaguete ase egetare, ekiagera kobaigure ring’ana riria, erio kegima baribwata nomogooko;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abwo tibari nemeri ime yabo abanyene, korende bagenderera ekero egeke, na ekero emechando gose okorosigwa bikooroka ase engencho ye ring’ana riria, bwango bagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende abande nabwo baria babusuirwe ase amagwa, aba nabwo bakoigwa ring’ana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende okorengereria gw’ense na obong’ainereria bw’eniibo, na okogania kw’amang’ana ande kogosoa, biamiga ring’ana riria, riaba tirikwama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende aba nabwo babusuirwe ase amaroba amaya, abwo n’abanto baria bakoigwa ring’ana riria, na koribwata, na kwama okwama, oyomo emerongo etato, oyomo emerongo etano nomo, na oyonde rigana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okworokereria korwa ase etaya na korwa ase embusuro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 13:31-35; Luk 8:16-18; 13:18-19)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabateebia, “Inee! Etaya nigo ekorentwa erinde yamumekwa negetonga gose yabekwa nyaro y’oborere? Teri kobekwa igoro ase ekebekerero?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki ring’ana tiriri ria bobisi ritache koorokigwa, gose eribisegete ritache koorokigwa maiso marore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto ore n’amato akoigwera, tiga aigwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Rigereria aya mokoigwa; na ekerengo keria mokorengera nakio morache korengerwa inwe, naende namomenterwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki oyobwate naegwe; korende oyotabwati naurwe nonya nekio abwate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobayeeno korwa ase embusuro egokina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akabora, “Oborwoti bwa Nyasae nigo bogwekaine nomonto obusurete embusuro ase riroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba okoraara botuko na koboka, mobaso, na embusuro eyio ekamera na gokiina, ere atamanyeti buna egokoreka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki ense nigo ekwama enyene, ritang’ani rinyansi, naende ekegara, erio enyeke ase ekegara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na endagera koyamire, omonto oyio bwango nigo akoira omoyio bwokogesa, ekiagera rigesa riaikire ang’e.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobayeeno bw’ententere y’omoaruni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akagenderera koboora, “Ninki torabogwekanie oborwoti bwa Nyasae? Gose tobobeke ase mobayeeno ki?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo bonga entetere y’omoaruni, ekero egosimekwa ase amaroba nenke kobua chimbusuro chionsi ase ense,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende koyasimekirwe, yakiina, yaba enene kobua emete yonsi y’amato, yaba ne chinsagia chinene; goika chinyoni chia igoro chinyare gokenderera ase ekiriri kiaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akaranderia abanto ring’ana riaye ase emebayeeno emenge ere buna eye; nigo arenge gokwana ring’ana ase bare, koreng’ana buna baare konyara koigwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gose taare kobateebia ring’ana otatiga ase omobayeeno, korende ekero arenge ensemo n’Aborokigwa baye nigo arenge kobateebia obobisi bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogotoereria omwaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 8:23-27; Luk 8:22-25)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria, rigachia koba mogoroba, akabateebia, “Twamboke gochia ng’umbu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagatiga omoganda, bakamoira amo nabarabwo, buna arenge, ase obwato boria. Na amaato ande narenge amo nere",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekembugu‐mbugu ekenene ki’omwaga gekaoroka, emerindo egaaka‐aka obwato goika amaache agachaaka goichora obwato ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere omonyene nigo arenge ase obwato ime magega oraire igoro ase omoito. Bakamotura, bakamoteebia, “Omworokia, tari gento ase ore gatogosira?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akaboka, agatogonyera omwaga, agateebia enyancha, “Kira, otoerere!” Omwaga okaera; gokaba ogotoerera okonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso agateebia aborokigwa baye, “Inaki mokwoboa inwe? Timori nokwegena?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagasogwa nomoondoko omonene, bagateebania, “Oyo ning’o rende, goika nonya nomwaga na enyancha bikomoigwera?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
